=====================

    TruSoft Computing LLC

   S~S  SimpleSal documents: metadata describing README documents and what will be read by you

=====================

   S~S This Repository

------------------------------------------

   S~S  What is the purpose of the objects in this repository?

    Describe the metadata that TSC LLC software projects use to describe the contents from various views.


------------------------------------------

   S~S  What are the contents of this repository?

   * the metadata selected by TSC LLC for use in describing TSC LLC repositories, in template form.

   * extensive suggestions, ideas, documentation about the use and content of the metadata files.

   The trick is that the extensive information about metadata is contained within the metadata file.

------------------------------------------

   S~S  What happens in my workspace as a result of interacting with this repository?

    The managed object will be placed into your workspace, along with the human metadata file
    (depending on your ability to configure the repo App to only consider files matching filters).

    The only reason to have a copy locally is if these files are being modified for a release.
    Readers still awake will realize the SimpleSal metadata about the directory content will
    match the name and therefore overwrite a conventional software package's local metadata files.
    This is a disadvantage resulting fro TSC LLC separates the managed object into a subdirectory.
------------------------------------------

